# Production settings are NOT kept in this file.
#
# The website's addresses are built into the site when GitHub Actions builds it, from the
# GitHub repository variables (Settings → Secrets and variables → Actions → Variables):
#   NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL       e.g. https://api.gokidsplay.co.uk/api/v1
#   NEXT_PUBLIC_FRONTEND_URL  e.g. https://www.gokidsplay.co.uk
# Server-only secrets (INTERNAL_PROXY_SECRET) go in Azure → gokidsplay-web → Environment variables.
# See DEPLOYMENT_GUIDE.md, Parts 4 and 6. The deploy workflow stops if the variables are missing.
